  m_Name: Evento_OndaMigratoria
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Onda Migrat\xF3ria"
  _titleEn: Migration Wave
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "A chegada r\xE1pida de muitas pessoas pressiona moradia, sa\xFAde e
    escolas, mas tamb\xE9m traz trabalhadores e diversidade."
  _summaryEn: The rapid arrival of many people strains housing, health care and schools,
    but also brings workers and diversity.
  _realWorld: "A Opera\xE7\xE3o Acolhida, criada em 2018, recebe em Roraima migrantes
    venezuelanos e ajuda a lev\xE1-los para outras cidades do Brasil."
  _realWorldEn: Operation Welcome, created in 2018, receives Venezuelan migrants
    in Roraima and helps relocate them to other Brazilian cities.
  _tradeOffs: "Sem acolhimento e distribui\xE7\xE3o, a cidade de chegada fica sobrecarregada
    e cresce a tens\xE3o social."
  _tradeOffsEn: Without reception and relocation, the arrival city is overwhelmed
    and social tension grows.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Opera\xE7\xE3o Acolhida (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opera%C3%A7%C3%A3o_Acolhida
